-*   **Output:** A set of occupied voxel coordinates (integer indices $ijk$), a sparse voxel grid, or a generated mesh/point cloud representing the voxelized surface [S1][S2, S4, unofficial].
+*   **Input:** A triangle mesh defined by vertices $V$ and faces $F$ [S1][S4, unofficial].
